Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Contacts title with its version; soft avatar tones;
 the shared FAB

The main list's title shows the installed version after "Contacts", muted,
as on every Plait app's root screen (PeopleActivity.setTitle, PlaitTitle).
Letter tiles use plait-design's three soft avatar tones; the contact page
header keeps the strong colours (plait_header_colors) for its white title.
The add button is the shared floating button: 16 dp corners on the
primary container, with a matching ripple and shadow outline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
